  "description": "MapSharp.NET is a lightweight, high-performance .NET object-to-object mapper with explicit configuration, fast runtime mapping, projection support, typed per-call options, map-into-existing-instance support, automatic proxy-aware source-type fallback, optional source-member validation, and explicit ignore support for read-only destination properties.",
